{
  "_comment": [
    "Development fixture: the real Planning Center reference topology, as of",
    "2026-09. Applied only by the dev-only `db-init` command, through the repo",
    "layer rather than raw SQL.",
    "",
    "planning_center_id values are REAL Planning Center ids, not synthetic ones,",
    "so the checkout fetcher and the room tree stay exercisable against the live",
    "API. Rows reference each other by natural key -- an event's planning center",
    "id, a group's name -- because the repos assign surrogate keys themselves.",
    "",
    "Deliberately absent: children, parents, checkins and guest_submissions.",
    "Those are per-visit transactional data and belong to `make random-data`.",
    "",
    "locations.auto_fetch is not seeded. No Go code reads or writes that column;",
    "auto-fetch is configured per event (events.auto_fetch), which is what the",
    "fetcher filters on."
  ],
